@startuml voxmetriks-architecture
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 32
top to bottom direction
title Voxmetriks — Despliegue (Medallion + SPA + API)

actor Usuario as Browser
actor Engineer as Eng
actor DevOps as Ops

rectangle Cliente {
  component "Angular SPA\n:4200" as SPA
}

rectangle "Docker Compose" {
  component "pipeline\nelt_pipeline.py" as Pipeline
  component "api\nFastAPI :8000" as API
  component "PocketBase\n(opcional)" as PB
  database "DuckDB\nvoxmetrik.duckdb" as VDB
}

Browser --> SPA : UI
Eng --> SPA : ELT / explorer
SPA --> API : REST /api/v1
Ops --> Pipeline : compose run
Pipeline --> PB : extract
Pipeline --> VDB : Bronze→Gold
API --> VDB : read/write

@enduml
